# GEMINI_API_KEY powers the AI chat.
# 1) Copy this file to ".env" (the .env file is git-ignored, never commit it)
# 2) Put your own key from https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
# 3) IMPORTANT: restrict the key in Google Cloud Console -> Credentials -> "Android apps"
#    (package name com.lifeeasy.app + your SHA-1 fingerprints). See docs/ for details.
GEMINI_API_KEY=MY_GEMINI_API_KEY
